    "source": [
     "# GrowthParameterEstimation Function Tour\n",
     "\n",
     "This notebook is a guided walkthrough of the package APIs.\n",
     "It includes: data layer, exposure profiles, model registry/simulation, fitting, analysis, and pipeline workflow."
    ]
   },
   {
    "cell_type": "code",
